# `backend/**` and `api/**` are the API and must never be excluded: the Python
# function imports the FastAPI app from backend/, and vercel.json pulls it into
# the function bundle with `includeFiles`.
#
# The frontend is NOT excluded any more. Vercel builds it with `npm run build`
# and serves dist/ from the same origin as the API, so the browser makes
# same-origin /api requests and no CORS configuration is involved.
node_modules
*.log
*.mp4
backend/.venv
backend/__pycache__
backend/**/__pycache__
